## API reference

### Checkbox

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `checked:` | `Boolean` | - | Initial state (inside a group, derived from the group's value). |
| `indeterminate:` | `Boolean` | `false` | The mixed state - a dash, announced as "mixed". Cleared by the first click. |
| `value:` | `String` | - | Submitted when checked; a group's identity for the box. |
| `unchecked_value:` | `String` | - | Submitted when unchecked (a hidden input before the box). |
| `parent:` | `Boolean` | `false` | In a CheckboxGroup, the "select all" box driven by the others. |
| `invalid:` | `Boolean` | - | Error state (`aria-invalid`); a Field sets it. |

Other attributes go to the `<input>`; `class:` to the box.

### CheckboxGroup

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `name:` | `String` | - | Shared by every box inside. |
| `default_value:` / `value:` | `Array` | `[]` | The checked boxes' values. |
| `orientation:` | `:vertical`, `:horizontal` | `:vertical` | A column, or a wrapping row. |
| `disabled:` | `Boolean` | `false` | Disables every box. |

Event: `appica-ui--checkbox-group:change` with `{ value }`.

## Accessibility

- A native checkbox: Space toggles it, the indeterminate state is announced as "mixed".
- Wrap it in a `<label>` with its text, or give it `aria_label:`. Name a group with `aria_label:` or
  `aria_labelledby:` - it's a `role="group"`.
- The check and press animations are skipped under `prefers-reduced-motion`.
